{"id":"steam-1378280","steam":1378280,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Stream Dogfighter","summary":"Turn your chat into a space battle! Host free-for-all dogfights, viewers battle via chat commands, watch their ships fight in free-for-all dogfights\r\n\r\nIs your stream geared towards space or scifi genre, now engage more with your viewers \r\nby giving them a space battle on your stream.","about":"Stream Dogfighter is a space ship dog-fighting game for   streamers.\r\n\nTurn your Twitch chat into a space battle\n\nStream Dogfighter lets Twitch streamers host spaceship battles with their viewers. Viewers join through chat commands, then watch their ships fight in free-for-all dogfights.\r\n\r\n\r\nWho will survive?\n\nBring your community into the action as viewers compete for victory. Use battles as a regular stream activity or a fun way to choose a winner instead of a traditional raffle.\n\nViewers participate through Twitch chat, while the streamer runs the game and broadcasts the action.\n\n\r\nFollow your results\n\nPlayers can visit the companion website to view their stats and recent matches, and customize their ship loadout. \n\n\r\n\nWant your favorite game mode added ? \n\nThen join our Discord => See Steam Links\r\n\n \n\nAvailable at Early Access launch\n\n• Chat vs Chat free-for-all battles. \r\n• Viewer participation through Twitch chat commands. \r\n• Player stats, recent match results, and ship loadout customization through the companion website.\n\nPlanned during Early Access\n\nWe plan to expand Stream Dogfighter with cooperative battles where viewers fight together against hostile ships, explore different combat areas, and take on group bosses.\n\nWe also want to introduce progression and rewards for co-op play, giving viewers more reasons to return and work together. Streamer vs Chat is another mode we aim to develop further.\r\n\r\n\nWhy isn’t Stream Dogfighter free?\n\nStream Dogfighter is a one-time purchase for the streamer, with no microtransactions. \r\nViewers can join through Twitch chat without buying the game.\n\nAll unlockable items are earned by playing or through drops—there’s no cash shop. \r\nPurchasing the game helps support its ongoing development.\r\n\nHelp shape the game\n\nStream Dogfighter is in active development. Join our Discord or Steam discussions to share feedback, report bugs, and help us improve the battles.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378280/library_600x900.jpg?t=1793732665","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378280/header.jpg?t=1793732665","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378280/library_hero.jpg?t=1793732665","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378280/header.jpg?t=1793732665","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378280/ss_cb8536bd745c394f6bc402fde3e3ea79ac9c6a81.600x338.jpg?t=1793732665","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378280/ss_cb8536bd745c394f6bc402fde3e3ea79ac9c6a81.jpg?t=1793732665"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378280/ss_e3bca3443a5002fbef0576af94b3ca3212b3d266.600x338.jpg?t=1793732665","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378280/ss_e3bca3443a5002fbef0576af94b3ca3212b3d266.jpg?t=1793732665"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378280/ss_ad3be927dee9a40224cca1496ebf450d0c65c1f0.600x338.jpg?t=1793732665","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378280/ss_ad3be927dee9a40224cca1496ebf450d0c65c1f0.jpg?t=1793732665"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378280/ss_a42b1e43d13b2a2ffc6b6bbdb23a16fe35144dac.600x338.jpg?t=1793732665","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com